; images.com as the customer's DNS provider serves it. These two records are the whole Dedan onboarding on the
; customer's side (ARCHITECTURE.md section 3): the site itself, and the ACME challenge delegation for managed TLS.
; An apex name cannot be a CNAME: use a subdomain such as www, or the provider's ALIAS record.
$ORIGIN images.com.
$TTL 300
www                  IN CNAME acme.dedan-cdn.test.
_acme-challenge.www  IN CNAME _acme-challenge.acme.dedan-cdn.test.
